  "plot_alt_text": "Plot of the GHZ spin parity expectation value of the product of sigma_x over all ions versus the phase phi for two ion numbers N. The N equals 2 curve oscillates as cosine of two phi and the N equals 3 curve as cosine of three phi, an N-fold faster Heisenberg-limited fringe. The numerical points lie exactly on the analytic cosine of N phi reference lines.",
